# TASK 2 — the web image.
#
# Start from an official PHP + Apache image and add what this app needs:
#
#   1. Base it on php:8.3-apache
#   2. Install the PDO MySQL driver (Example 5's web/Dockerfile shows the command)
#   3. COPY src/ into Apache's document root, /var/www/html/
#
# The COPY matters even though docker-compose.yml will also sync src/ with
# `watch`: the copy is what makes the image work on a machine that is not yours.

